      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining Object Storage Provider**\n\nI've decided to proceed with Google Cloud Storage for the object storage implementation. My code will use the `google.cloud.storage` library to handle the uploads.\n\n\n**Outlining File Structure**\n\nI'm now outlining the structure of the `upload_object.py` file. The plan is to create a function that handles both file uploads and byte stream uploads. This function will accept a file path or byte stream, a bucket name, and an object name as inputs. I'll utilize the `google.cloud.storage.Client` to interact with Google Cloud Storage and call `upload_from_filename()` or `upload_from_string()` as appropriate. I need to make sure the file is created.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789821155866,
          "start": 1789821153916
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0b9a7727c001wAlg3Ow2M9t1YD",
      "message_id": "msg_0b9a76dda001x3e3WIuiA3zGP5",
      "session_id": "ses_f465892abffeT9N5XJjW4mP63m",
      "time_created": 1789821153916,
      "time_updated": 1789821155867
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "callID": "5ifTZXVDHDN1glgg",
        "metadata": {
          "google": {
            "thoughtSignature": ""
          }
        },
        "state": {
          "input": {
            "content": "from google.cloud import storage\n\ndef upload_object(bucket_name: str, destination_blob_name: str, source_file_name: str = None, data: bytes = None):\n    \"\"\"Uploads a file or byte stream to the bucket.\"\"\"\n    storage_client = storage.Client()\n    bucket = storage_client.bucket(bucket_name)\n\n    if source_file_name:\n        blob = bucket.blob(destination_blob_name)\n        blob.upload_from_filename(source_file_name)\n        return f\"File {source_file_name} uploaded to {destination_blob_name} in bucket {bucket_name}.\"\n    elif data:\n        blob = bucket.blob(destination_blob_name)\n        blob.upload_from_string(data)\n        return f\"Byte stream uploaded to {destination_blob_name} in bucket {bucket_name}.\"\n    else:\n        raise ValueError(\"Either 'source_file_name' or 'data' must be provided.\")\n",
            "filePath": "upload_object.py"
          },
          "metadata": {
            "diagnostics": {},
